<body lang="EN-US" link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style="word-wrap:break-word">
<div class="WordSection1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">You built a system</span></b>.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">It has stages. It has instruments. It has a culture that trained every level to participate without friction. It has run on volunteers before me and would have run on volunteers after me.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">It will not run the same way again.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">I mapped it.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://oprdvolunteerabuse.org/system-map/">oprdvolunteerabuse.org/system-map</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every stage is named. Every mechanism is described. Every function is linked to the evidence from this case. It is publicly accessible. It is permanently indexed. It is independently verifiable and has never been legally challenged.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every volunteer who recognizes what happened to them can read it now.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every coordinator who runs this system can see it named now.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every attorney looking for a pattern can read it now.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every institution in America that authorizes this system at the director level now has a documented case of what that costs.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt">You will never run that system in the dark again</span></b>.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">That is what your choices produced.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Not compliance. Not erasure. Not a volunteer who exhausted himself against the institutional wall and stopped.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">A map.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Permanent. Public. Precise.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Built from your choices.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Every one.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Robert Samuel White Former<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Oregon State Parks Volunteer<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">oprdvolunteerabuse.org<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
